WezTerm Mobile
==============

This repository contains two bodies of work:

1. The `wezterm/` directory is a vendored copy of WezTerm
   (https://github.com/wez/wezterm), release 20240203-110809-5046fc22,
   Copyright (c) Wez Furlong and contributors, licensed under the MIT license
   (see wezterm/LICENSE.md). It is included with small modifications documented
   in docs/UPSTREAM-CHANGES.md (iOS portability, dependency feature gating, and
   two new crates: wezterm/wezterm-ios-core and wezterm/poc-attach).

2. Everything else (the iOS application under ios/, the new crates, and the
   documentation) is Copyright (c) 2026 Nyaga, licensed under the MIT license
   (see LICENSE).

WezTerm Mobile is an independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the WezTerm project.
